  "description": "meme-id: frog_meme; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a cartoon frog with text that reads 'Share the meme instead of tagging your friends' at the top and 'you fucking niggers' at the bottom. The frog is visually mapped to the text 'niggers' via the juxtaposition of the animal imagery and the racial slur, creating a hateful message. The intent is to use a derogatory racial stereotype (comparing Black people to primates) to insult or demean individuals or communities based on race. This constitutes a direct hateful attack targeting Black people, falling under the 'hateful' category as it is explicitly racist and offensive. The meme is designed to provoke, insult, and spread hate based on racial identity.",
